WEBVTT

00:05:29.392 --> 00:05:31.062
But that's not completely true.

00:05:31.472 --> 00:05:32.976
Recent studies

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:35.861
by satellites such as the WMAP satellite

00:05:35.885 --> 00:05:37.462
have shown that, in fact,

00:05:37.486 --> 00:05:40.235
there are just tiny differences
in that background.

00:05:40.259 --> 00:05:41.976
What you see here,

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:46.306
the blue areas are about a thousandth
of a degree cooler

00:05:46.330 --> 00:05:47.722
than the red areas.

00:05:47.746 --> 00:05:49.119
These are tiny differences,

00:05:49.143 --> 00:05:51.413
but it was enough
for the universe to move on

00:05:51.437 --> 00:05:53.412
to the next stage of building complexity.

00:05:53.436 --> 00:05:54.628
And this is how it works.

00:05:55.635 --> 00:05:59.883
Gravity is more powerful
where there's more stuff.